<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's Mercury sees NZ$81.6 mln full year profit.</title>
<headline>NZ's Mercury sees NZ$81.6 mln full year profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unlisted New Zealand electricity supplier Mercury Energy on Wednesday said it expected its full year after-tax profit to be NZ$81.6 million, up 24 percent on the previous year.</p>
<p>Mercury also announced an unaudited net profit after tax of $53.9 million for the six months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
